# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by design
# Severity: UNKNOWN
# Component: golang.org/x/crypto v0.58.0
# Fixed Version: v0.58.1-0.20261009181718-2f1f834330b2 (removes the openpgp package)
